        },
        {
          "id": "chapel_intro",
          "title": "礼堂",
          "kind": "story",
          "sceneImage": "public/art/scenes/locations/auditorium.png",
          "text": "因为是教会女校，所以会有一个小教堂，但唱圣歌的会有佛教徒和神道教徒与无神论者……还会有什么呢？",
          "next": {
            "kind": "node",
            "id": "warehouse_door"
